title: Taxes and Loans
subtitle: Treasury: a progressive tax, indirect taxes, a domestic loan, emission or savings.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_finance.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'finance_package') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.finance_package (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.3). Z — 0.93 (decision 3A of 24 X 2026):
// one Treasury card with five instruments of 11.9 — two taxes, the loan, emission and savings; until 0.92 the family had two
// cards (taxes, and the loan, savings and emission). Opening and closing the card are free; a confirmed option costs this
// month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'finance_package');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_finance');
!}

= Taxes and loans

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

One instrument per decision, voted by the Sejm at once; one instrument of each kind can be in force, and a temporary revenue ends when it expires.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

- @progressive
- @indirect
- @loan
- @emission
- @admin_cuts
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@progressive
title: Tax high incomes and wealth: a progressive tax
subtitle: Taxes rise one level, which brings the budget 1 unit a month; business pressure grows (+4); Lewica dissent falls (−3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'progressive').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_progressive_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'progressive');
!}
go-to: result

@indirect
title: Tax broad groups: indirect taxes
subtitle: Taxes rise one level, which brings the budget 1 unit a month; the discontent of poor recipients grows (+3); Lewica dissent rises (+3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'indirect').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_indirect_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'indirect');
!}
go-to: result

@loan
title: Domestic loan
subtitle: Brings the budget 3 units a month for six months, then costs it 1 unit a month for twelve months. Needs credit of at least 40.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'loan').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_loan_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'loan');
!}
go-to: result

@emission
title: Emission financing
subtitle: Before the złoty: printing within an authorised limit of 1–3 points; after it: transitional coinage, 1 point for three months.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'emission').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_emission_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'emission');
!}
go-to: result

@admin_cuts
title: Savings in named administrative spending
subtitle: Brings the budget 1 unit a month for six months; the discontent of the public employees named grows (+4).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'admin_cuts').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_admin_cuts_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'admin_cuts');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

